sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Developer
  participant P as Pi CLI
  participant S as Subagents
  participant K as Knowledge Store

  D->>P: plan the task
  P->>S: scout · spawn investigator, builder, reviewer
  Note over S: runs in parallel
  S-->>P: findings + diffs
  P->>P: execute verified changes
  P->>K: persist learning
  K-->>P: context for next plan
  Note over D,K: plan → implement → verify loop
